El Tesoro issued only 500 million with 5.28%, compared with 750 million with 4.81% of the previous auction.
Thus, the rates in Portugal fell 30 points lower, reflecting the change in the mood in the market, which occurred after Tricheta's words.
in Ireland, the figures have been published representing the losses of Allied and the Bank of Ireland.
